{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solitaire Battle</strong> is a roguelike on a solitaire board where the cards you pick up let you attack, synergize, and slay fantastical opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A roguelike deckbuilding autobattler inspired by games like <i>Balatro</i> and <i>SNKRX</i>!</strong> Pick and draw cards to trigger attacks and abilities, build decks with wild synergies, and face enemies who make you play solitaire in unique and strategic ways!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Become a dwarf</strong> who digs up cards to keep the opponent stunned, a knight who fills the board with shields, or a monk who waits for the right moment to unleash a powerful combo of attacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Wishlist and follow </strong>to be updated when Solitaire Battle releases!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo contains a limit of 12 rounds of solitaire to battle across, two playable characters, 16 bosses to face, and two playable difficulty modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809320/extras/b334254d1c5b730823a547454803feb7.poster.avif?t=1751667945\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809320/extras/b334254d1c5b730823a547454803feb7.webm?t=1751667945\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809320/extras/b334254d1c5b730823a547454803feb7.mp4?t=1751667945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nostalgic tri-peaks solitaire\u00a0gameplay</strong> with a roguelike deckbuilding twist - pick up, draw, and discard cards to strategically defeat your opponents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade your deck </strong>of equipment at the shop after every battle to get strong enough to break the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Discover new synergies and builds </strong>every playthrough from a random pool of weapons, skills, and passive items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Devious enemies and bosses </strong>will cleverly fight back with their own attacks and harmful status effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Defeat the final boss to gain treasures</strong> that unlock new playable heroes and difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Still not done!? </strong>Continue after winning with increased difficulty to reach a state of solitaire flow and put your build to the test against the ultimate opponents</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809320/extras/aa533f0ff8cef57fac44568391ff46d9.poster.avif?t=1751667945\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809320/extras/aa533f0ff8cef57fac44568391ff46d9.apng?t=1751667945\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Jack Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3809320/5771211529034a48598cc4d5021986f2ec06c7be.jpg"},{"name":"Queen Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3809320/c889f8abbd8bff0afd7e46b618cb508332f3dde9.jpg"},{"name":"Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3809320/8c0998efbb49000175b289c5ba5466f2af0741f8.jpg"},{"name":"Treasure Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3809320/87a21df427805ec272ad9e87093ec2036d2d5512.jpg"},{"name":"Treasure-seeking Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3809320/440d1f2ad26253abb851ebe6